hiocyanate end group instead of amine was found exclusively in the mass spectrum (Kim Y, Jacobson KA, unpublished results).</p></fn><fn><p><bold>Electronic supplementary material</bold></p><p>The online version of this article (doi:10.1007/s11302-008-9113-3) contains supplementary material, which is available to authorized users.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>